==== Opening the case ====

**Note:** This will void your warranty!

**Note:** This is copied from the higher specification Netgear WAX206, but should be the same.

**Note that the right side panel cannot be removed without removing the pcb mounting screws (internal access)! **

To open the case, the bottom stand must first be removed, there are two screws holding it on. These screws will prevent the left side panel from being removed. 
Next pry the left side panel free. This panel is held to the main body with plastic clips, I used a plastic pry bar around all the edges and shims to prevent re-latching while working.

